{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31799","headline":"即事 · 贾岛","name":"即事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"索莫对孤灯，阴云积几层。\n自嗟怜十上，谁肯待三徵。\n心被通人见，文叨大匠称。\n悲秋秦塞草，怀古汉家陵。\n城静高崖树，漏多幽沼冰。\n过声沙岛鹭，绝行石庵僧。\n岂谓旧庐在，谁言归未曾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31799.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31799","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}